{"seq":3,"slug":"timeout-and-budget-propagation","title":"超时与预算传播：让整条调用链共享同一个\"还剩多久\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/cascading-failure-and-isolation/timeout-and-budget-propagation","wordCount":2215,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"超时与预算传播-让整条调用链共享同一个-还剩多久\">超时与预算传播：让整条调用链共享同一个&quot;还剩多久&quot;</h1><p>一个用户点击了&quot;提交订单&quot;。浏览器愿意等 8 秒，可它把请求交给前端服务时，没有附带这个约束。前端调用订单服务时重新设了一个 5 秒超时，订单服务调用库存服务时又设了 3 秒，库存服务查数据库时设了 10 秒。结果是：当用户早已关掉页面、浏览器早已超时，数据库还在埋头跑那条没人等待的查询。这就是缺少&quot;超时预算传播&quot;的典型症状——每一跳各自为政地猜测自己该等多久，没有任何一层知道整个请求的真实剩余时间。本文讲的，是如何让一个&quot;剩余时间预算&quot;沿调用链一路向下传递，从而在级联故障发生前就掐断无意义的工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-deadline-是绝对时刻-timeout-是相对时长\">核心概念：deadline 是绝对时刻，timeout 是相对时长</h2><p>理解传播的前提，是先分清两个常被混用的词。timeout 是&quot;从现在起 5 秒&quot;这样的相对时长；deadline 是&quot;2026 年 1 月 8 日 10:30:00 UTC&quot;这样的绝对时刻。gRPC 在内部会把客户端给的 timeout 立刻换算成一个 deadline，然后让这个 deadline 跨越服务边界传播，下游服务收到的不是&quot;你有 5 秒&quot;，而是&quot;你必须在这个绝对时刻前完成&quot;（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-01-08-grpc-deadlines-timeouts/view\">oneuptime, 2026-01-08</a>）。</p>\n<p>这个区分不是咬文嚼字。传播 deadline 而非 timeout，是整个机制能成立的关键：每一跳都已经消耗了一部分时间，如果向下游传的还是原始的&quot;5 秒&quot;，那么 deadline 会随调用深度不断被重置，越深的服务反而以为自己时间越充裕。下面用一张图说明两种传法在三层调用下的差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[客户端&lt;br/&gt;deadline = T0 + 8s] --&gt; B{传播方式}&#10;  B --&gt;|传 deadline 绝对时刻| C[前端: 截止 = T0+8s&lt;br/&gt;已耗 1s 剩 7s]&#10;  C --&gt; D[订单服务: 截止 = T0+8s&lt;br/&gt;已耗 3s 剩 5s]&#10;  D --&gt; E[库存服务: 截止 = T0+8s&lt;br/&gt;剩 4s 到点即停]&#10;  B --&gt;|传 timeout 相对时长| F[前端: 我有 8s]&#10;  F --&gt; G[订单: 我又有 8s]&#10;  G --&gt; H[库存: 我还有 8s&lt;br/&gt;总耗时可达 24s]\">flowchart TD\n  A[客户端&lt;br/&gt;deadline = T0 + 8s] --&gt; B{传播方式}\n  B --&gt;|传 deadline 绝对时刻| C[前端: 截止 = T0+8s&lt;br/&gt;已耗 1s 剩 7s]\n  C --&gt; D[订单服务: 截止 = T0+8s&lt;br/&gt;已耗 3s 剩 5s]\n  D --&gt; E[库存服务: 截止 = T0+8s&lt;br/&gt;剩 4s 到点即停]\n  B --&gt;|传 timeout 相对时长| F[前端: 我有 8s]\n  F --&gt; G[订单: 我又有 8s]\n  G --&gt; H[库存: 我还有 8s&lt;br/&gt;总耗时可达 24s]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传播 timeout（错误做法）</th>\n<th>传播 deadline（正确做法）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传递的内容</td>\n<td>相对时长，每跳重置</td>\n<td>绝对时刻，全链共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深层服务的认知</td>\n<td>越深以为时间越多</td>\n<td>越深越清楚剩余预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受时钟影响</td>\n<td>较小（各跳本地计时）</td>\n<td>需处理跨机器时钟偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无人等待时的行为</td>\n<td>下游继续空跑</td>\n<td>到点即取消，释放资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与级联故障的关系</td>\n<td>放大资源占用</td>\n<td>主动止损</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"预算如何沿调用链递减\">预算如何沿调用链递减</h2><p>把整条链路想成一个共享的时间钱包。请求树顶端设定一个总预算（绝对 deadline），每经过一层，服务先扣掉自己已经花掉的时间，把剩下的余额交给下一层；下游只能在这个余额内工作（<a href=\"https://blog.mi.hdm-stuttgart.de/index.php/2022/03/03/cascading-failures-in-large-scale-distributed-systems/\">HdM Stuttgart blog</a>）。</p>\n<p>设请求在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 进入系统，总预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，则任意一跳调用下游前，该跳可用的剩余预算为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>remaining</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{remaining}} = D - (t_{\\text{now}} - t_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remaining</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在把请求转给下游之前，成熟的实现还会预留一笔&quot;安全余量&quot;，扣掉网络往返与本地排队的开销，避免把一个已经几乎用尽的预算丢给下游让它白忙一场：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>downstream</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>remaining</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>network</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>margin</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{downstream}} = B_{\\text{remaining}} - t_{\\text{network}} - t_{\\text{margin}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">downstream</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remaining</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">network</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">margin</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>downstream</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{downstream}} \\le 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">downstream</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，正确的做法是连请求都不要发出，直接以&quot;deadline exceeded&quot;快速失败——这一步常被忽视，却是省下最多无效工作的地方。Go 生态里这套机制由 <code>context.Context</code> 承载：父 context 带着 deadline，每次向下调用都派生子 context，cancel 信号会沿树向下广播，让所有还在跑的下游 goroutine 立刻收手（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-01-25-propagate-timeouts-context-go-services/view\">oneuptime, 2026-01-25</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (s *OrderService) Place(ctx context.Context, req *Req) error {&#10;    // ctx 已携带客户端传来的 deadline，不要在这里另起一个固定超时&#10;    remaining := time.Until(deadlineOf(ctx))&#10;    if remaining &lt;= networkMargin {&#10;        return status.Error(codes.DeadlineExceeded, &quot;预算不足，不再下探&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;    // 派生的子调用自动继承 deadline；无需手动减&#10;    return s.inventory.Reserve(ctx, req.Items)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OrderService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Place</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Req</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // ctx 已携带客户端传来的 deadline，不要在这里另起一个固定超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Until</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">deadlineOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> networkMargin {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(codes.DeadlineExceeded, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"预算不足，不再下探\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 派生的子调用自动继承 deadline；无需手动减</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.inventory.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reserve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, req.Items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键纪律是：业务代码里不要再凭空 <code>WithTimeout(ctx, 3*time.Second)</code> 覆盖一个固定值。那样做等于把上游传来的预算丢掉，重新回到&quot;各猜各的&quot;的混乱状态。只有当本地操作确有独立的、更紧的硬上限时，才取&quot;现有 deadline 与本地上限的较小者&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时钟偏移-传绝对时刻的代价\">时钟偏移：传绝对时刻的代价</h2><p>传播绝对 deadline 有一个隐藏前提——参与的机器对&quot;现在几点&quot;有共识。可分布式系统里这恰恰最不可靠。clock skew（时钟偏移）是两台机器时钟读数之差，clock drift（时钟漂移）是走时速率之差；漂移非零会让偏移随时间持续累积（<a href=\"https://www.baeldung.com/cs/clock-offset-skew-difference\">Baeldung</a>）。如果接收方的墙上时钟比发送方快了 200ms，它会把一个其实还剩 500ms 的 deadline 当成只剩 300ms，提前放弃；反之则会超出预算继续空跑。</p>\n<p>应对之道分两层。其一，跨机器传递时尽量传&quot;剩余时长&quot;而不是绝对墙上时刻，由接收方用本地单调时钟（monotonic clock）重新换算成自己的本地 deadline——单调时钟不受 NTP 校时与回拨影响，专门用于度量时间间隔（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-02-06-resolve-clock-skew-opentelemetry-distributed-traces/view\">oneuptime, 2026-02-06</a>）。其二，全机群统一用 NTP 对齐墙上时钟以收敛偏移。gRPC 协议层正是这么设计的：线上传的是 <code>grpc-timeout</code> 这个相对值，每个 hop 收到后用本地时钟把它变成本地 deadline，从而绕开了&quot;两台机器是否对绝对时刻达成一致&quot;这个难题。OpenTelemetry 追踪里也建议手工 span 用单调时钟算 duration，避免跨服务时间线错乱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与级联故障的耦合-预算和重试必须协同\">与级联故障的耦合：预算和重试必须协同</h2><p>超时预算单独存在时只是省资源；真正致命的级联，发生在它和重试相乘的时候。Google SRE 的经典账：若数据库过载，而后端、前端、JS 三层各自重试 3 次（即每层 4 次尝试），一次用户操作会在数据库上放大成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^3 = 64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 次尝试（<a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/addressing-cascading-failures/\">Google SRE Book</a>）。预算传播在这里有两重作用——一是让深层重试在预算耗尽时立刻停止（没预算就别重试），二是配合&quot;重试预算&quot;把放大系数压回可控区间。</p>\n<p>Google 的具体做法是给每个客户端设&quot;重试预算&quot;：客户端统计重试请求占总请求的比例，只有当这个比例低于 10% 时才允许重试，否则直接失败（<a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/addressing-cascading-failures/\">Google SRE Book</a>）。同时遵循&quot;只在紧邻被拒绝层的上一层重试&quot;，并用&quot;overloaded; don&#39;t retry&quot;这类显式错误码阻止跨层的组合式重试爆炸。2026 年的复盘文章也给出同一结论：多数线上事故并非来自玄妙的 bug，而是&quot;无界重试 × 过长超时 × 共享连接池在压力下&quot;这几个可预测的乘数互相叠加（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-01-08-grpc-deadlines-timeouts/view\">oneuptime, 2026-01-08</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>与预算传播的修法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每跳重设固定超时</td>\n<td>总耗时随深度线性膨胀</td>\n<td>传 deadline，越深预算越紧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深层 RPC 比上层 deadline 还长</td>\n<td>上层早超时，下层仍在跑</td>\n<td>子 deadline 永不超过父 deadline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每层独立重试</td>\n<td>放大系数按层数指数增长</td>\n<td>重试预算 + 只在紧邻上层重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算耗尽仍发请求</td>\n<td>下游做注定被丢弃的工作</td>\n<td>发请求前先判 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>downstream</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{downstream}}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">downstream</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地的硬约束\">工程落地的硬约束</h2><p>让传播真正生效，需要把若干约定写成不可绕过的规则。第一，强制所有 RPC 显式带 deadline。Dropbox 在每个服务定义里都要求带 deadline，因为&quot;没有任何调用可以永远等下去&quot;消除了大量可靠性问题（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-01-30-grpc-deadlines-best-practices/view\">oneuptime, 2026-01-30</a>）。第二，用框架级机制自动传播而非手工传：ASP.NET Core 的 gRPC 客户端工厂配合 <code>EnableCallContextPropagation()</code> 会自动把取消令牌沿链传下去（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/grpc/deadlines-cancellation?view=aspnetcore-10.0\">Microsoft Learn</a>）；C++/Go 的 userver 框架则内建了 deadline propagation（<a href=\"https://userver.tech/d6/d64/md_en_2userver_2deadline__propagation.html\">userver</a>）。第三，把&quot;deadline exceeded&quot;当作正常路径来处理，客户端与服务端两侧都要优雅响应，而不是当成意外异常。第四，监控超出 deadline 的请求数量，它是发现性能退化与预算设置不当的最直接信号。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[入口设定总预算 D] --&gt; B[每跳: 剩余 = D 减 已耗]&#10;  B --&gt; C{剩余 减 余量 大于 0 ?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[快速失败&lt;br/&gt;不发下游请求]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[派生子 context&lt;br/&gt;带继承的 deadline]&#10;  E --&gt; F[调用下游]&#10;  F --&gt; G{下游超 deadline ?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[取消传播&lt;br/&gt;收回所有空跑工作]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[返回结果]&#10;  H --&gt; J[按重试预算判断是否重试]&#10;  J --&gt; K[比例小于阈值才重试&lt;br/&gt;否则直接失败]\">flowchart TD\n  A[入口设定总预算 D] --&gt; B[每跳: 剩余 = D 减 已耗]\n  B --&gt; C{剩余 减 余量 大于 0 ?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[快速失败&lt;br/&gt;不发下游请求]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[派生子 context&lt;br/&gt;带继承的 deadline]\n  E --&gt; F[调用下游]\n  F --&gt; G{下游超 deadline ?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[取消传播&lt;br/&gt;收回所有空跑工作]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[返回结果]\n  H --&gt; J[按重试预算判断是否重试]\n  J --&gt; K[比例小于阈值才重试&lt;br/&gt;否则直接失败]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>deadline 是绝对时刻、timeout 是相对时长；跨服务传播的应是&quot;剩余预算&quot;，让越深的服务越清楚自己时间还剩多少，而不是越深越以为时间充裕。</li>\n<li>每跳的剩余预算按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>remaining</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{remaining}} = D - (t_{\\text{now}} - t_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remaining</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 递减，下探前再扣网络与排队余量；余量不足时连请求都不要发，直接快速失败。</li>\n<li>传绝对时刻要付时钟偏移的代价；实践中传相对时长 + 接收方用单调时钟换算 + 全机群 NTP 对齐，是更稳的组合。</li>\n<li>超时预算必须与重试预算协同：无界重试会把放大系数推到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^3=64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 这种量级，靠&quot;重试占比低于 10% 才重试&quot;和&quot;只在紧邻上层重试&quot;把它压回可控。</li>\n<li>落地靠硬约束：强制每个 RPC 带 deadline、用框架自动传播、把 deadline exceeded 当正常路径处理、并持续监控超时请求数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"超时与预算传播：让整条调用链共享同一个\"还剩多久\"","id":"超时与预算传播-让整条调用链共享同一个-还剩多久"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：deadline 是绝对时刻，timeout 是相对时长","id":"核心概念-deadline-是绝对时刻-timeout-是相对时长"},{"level":2,"text":"预算如何沿调用链递减","id":"预算如何沿调用链递减"},{"level":2,"text":"时钟偏移：传绝对时刻的代价","id":"时钟偏移-传绝对时刻的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"与级联故障的耦合：预算和重试必须协同","id":"与级联故障的耦合-预算和重试必须协同"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地的硬约束","id":"工程落地的硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"舱壁隔离模式：把故障关进水密舱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/cascading-failure-and-isolation/bulkhead-isolation"},"next":{"title":"优雅降级模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/graceful-degradation-and-fault-tolerance/graceful-degradation-patterns"}}